435:2.2.1 OpenDocument Package
436-
437-An OpenDocument Package shall meet the following requirements:
438-
439-A)It shall be a Zip file, as defined by [ZIP]. All files contained in the Zip file shall be non compressed (STORED) or compressed using the “deflate” (DEFLATED) algorithm. 
440-
441-B)It shall contain a file “META-INF/manifest.xml”. This file shall meet the following requirements: 
442-B.1)The file shall be a well formed XML document in accordance with the [XML1.0] specification. 
443-
444-B.2)The XML root element of the file shall be a <manifest:manifest> element 4.2. 
445-
446-B.3)The XML file shall be valid with respect to the manifest schema defined in appendix A.1 OpenDocument Manifest Schema. 
447-
448-C)It should contain a file “mimetype”. 
